WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.960
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:11.230 --> 00:14.460
[Ryu Se-il]

3
00:18.880 --> 00:22.340
[Ha Junghoon]

4
00:26.410 --> 00:29.660
[Lee Jungchan]

5
00:33.480 --> 00:36.980
[Jeong Siwan]

6
00:42.340 --> 00:47.020
[Boy, with Caution]

7
00:56.610 --> 00:57.860
You're a guy.

8
00:58.330 --> 00:59.410
Yeah.

9
01:00.770 --> 01:03.480
I told you before that I'm a guy.

10
01:04.580 --> 01:05.790
Did you?

11
01:05.990 --> 01:07.610
I'm forgetful.

12
01:09.180 --> 01:11.170
Are you going to run away now that you know I'm a guy?

13
01:11.170 --> 01:12.610
Why'd I run away?

14
01:14.000 --> 01:16.530
It's even more interesting that you're a guy.

15
01:17.350 --> 01:18.789
What's your name?

16
01:20.400 --> 01:22.090
I'm Kim Jitae.

17
01:28.670 --> 01:32.470
Do I have to explain the characters of my name for you to tell me yours?

18
01:36.660 --> 01:38.190
I'm Jang Kiwoo.

19
01:41.910 --> 01:44.140
Does he have no friends?

20
01:44.270 --> 01:45.280
Mom,

21
01:45.390 --> 01:46.050
Secretary,

22
01:46.070 --> 01:47.800
Teacher—Mr. Jang Kiwoo.

23
01:53.470 --> 01:55.030
Jang Kiwoo?

24
02:05.870 --> 02:07.160
What is it?

25
02:08.259 --> 02:10.889
Where are you right now?

26
02:13.520 --> 02:15.020
I'm busy.

27
02:15.960 --> 02:17.680
I asked where you are.

28
02:17.820 --> 02:19.480
I said I'm busy.

29
02:20.480 --> 02:21.910
I'm hanging up.

30
02:25.200 --> 02:27.200
Good thing we met up.

31
02:28.850 --> 02:31.550
You're a bit different from what I imagined.

32
02:32.340 --> 02:34.230
This type. I see.

33
02:35.150 --> 02:36.410
A bit surprising.

34
02:38.290 --> 02:39.780
What's surprising?

35
02:39.970 --> 02:41.630
I just mean it's interesting.

36
02:41.750 --> 02:43.170
It's different.

37
02:44.340 --> 02:46.970
I want to keep seeing you.

38
02:48.760 --> 02:51.050
How should I address you?

39
02:51.700 --> 02:54.829
How about "hyung?" [Honorific to address an older male]

40
02:55.440 --> 02:57.130
Kiwoo-hyung.

41
02:55.820 --> 03:11.430
[Boy, with Caution] [Episode 6]

42
02:57.720 --> 02:59.630
Can I call you that?

43
03:20.850 --> 03:22.680
Long time no see, Hyunjae!

44
03:24.620 --> 03:25.780
Beom.

45
03:28.900 --> 03:30.300
Go to Nakwon-dong.

46
03:41.130 --> 03:43.770
You really smashed my men's faces.

47
03:48.800 --> 03:50.800
Is Jang Kiwoo that important to you?

48
03:52.710 --> 03:54.270
What did you say to him?

49
03:54.400 --> 03:56.600
You heard it all, didn't you?

50
03:57.310 --> 03:59.560
I should've got you a coffee too.

51
03:59.720 --> 04:01.450
Kiwoo-hyung bought it.

52
04:12.900 --> 04:14.880
By the way, that's your type?

53
04:15.930 --> 04:20.820
It's more intense and dull than I expected.

54
04:29.620 --> 04:30.580
Where's my phone?

55
04:30.580 --> 04:32.520
I gave it to Jang Kiwoo.

56
04:38.720 --> 04:40.020
Just kidding.

57
04:40.260 --> 04:41.550
Are you scared?

58
04:42.690 --> 04:46.090
I can't just give it to you. I spent 10 million on it. (~$7,500)

59
04:46.270 --> 04:49.050
Plus, the medical fees for my men's faces.

60
04:49.170 --> 04:52.430
And mental compensation for making me take the blame alone

61
04:52.550 --> 04:54.480
and getting expelled from school.

62
04:54.970 --> 04:59.510
And the time and coffee money spent to see Mr. Jang Kiwoo.

63
05:00.460 --> 05:02.720
Let's settle for 20 million. (~$15,000)

64
05:04.950 --> 05:06.390
What if I don't agree?

65
05:10.690 --> 05:12.810
I figured you'd say that, and I thought about it.

66
05:12.810 --> 05:16.210
You owe me money. I can't just let you walk. I need collateral.

67
05:16.400 --> 05:18.940
I have nothing to give you as collateral.

68
05:22.220 --> 05:23.670
How could you not?

69
05:24.450 --> 05:26.100
You have Jang Kiwoo.

70
05:28.050 --> 05:30.400
Messing with your parents and school or asking you for money

71
05:30.400 --> 05:32.840
doesn't faze you—I know that much.

72
05:32.850 --> 05:35.680
I'll give you two days.

73
05:36.840 --> 05:39.050
If you don't bring the money in two days,

74
05:39.370 --> 05:41.470
your teacher is done for.

75
05:46.890 --> 05:48.409
How about it?

76
05:52.370 --> 05:54.270
Okay, deal.

77
05:56.110 --> 05:58.350
But can I ask one question?

78
05:59.010 --> 06:00.640
You started that chat

79
06:01.140 --> 06:04.040
knowing full well it was Jang Kiwoo, didn't you?

80
06:08.010 --> 06:09.340
Congratulations.

81
06:13.770 --> 06:16.140
You finally have something to lose.

82
06:36.040 --> 06:38.040
Why are you here at this hour?

83
06:45.260 --> 06:46.580
What's the matter?

84
06:46.900 --> 06:48.550
You started that chat

85
06:48.710 --> 06:51.640
knowing full well it was Jang Kiwoo, didn't you?

86
07:05.150 --> 07:06.710
I did it...

87
07:08.690 --> 07:11.720
because I like you.

88
07:15.490 --> 07:17.960
So don't be too mad.

89
07:28.010 --> 07:29.800
What exactly do you want me to do

90
07:31.460 --> 07:33.060
for you to give up?

91
07:35.909 --> 07:37.190
For you to stop this?

92
07:40.909 --> 07:42.600
I won't give up.

93
07:42.730 --> 07:44.070
Lee Hyunjae.

94
07:44.800 --> 07:46.150
I'll keep going and giving,

95
07:46.150 --> 07:48.310
whether it's affection or love.

96
07:50.800 --> 07:53.560
You don't have to do anything.

97
07:54.960 --> 07:56.960
You can play dumb too.

98
08:07.010 --> 08:09.110
I've said everything I wanted to say.

99
08:10.330 --> 08:11.580
I'll get going.

100
08:49.110 --> 08:50.200
Hey.

101
08:50.420 --> 08:51.810
Two days ago...

102
08:54.070 --> 08:55.760
what did you give Kim Jungha?

103
08:56.370 --> 08:57.170
What?

104
08:57.320 --> 08:59.700
You clearly made a deal with him.

105
08:59.850 --> 09:01.090
What was it?

106
09:01.410 --> 09:02.910
I didn't.

107
09:04.070 --> 09:05.450
We were just chatting.

108
09:05.590 --> 09:06.730
I heard you do drugs.

109
09:09.910 --> 09:11.410
Who said that?

110
09:11.750 --> 09:14.590
I don't care if you do drugs or not.

111
09:14.870 --> 09:17.070
I don't like Choi Youngmoon too anyway.

112
09:18.720 --> 09:20.040
Then?

113
09:20.590 --> 09:21.690
Why are you asking me—

114
09:21.690 --> 09:23.010
For Jungha.

115
09:23.630 --> 09:25.510
You know what he's doing, right?

116
09:28.100 --> 09:29.630
I thought you weren't close to him.

117
09:29.630 --> 09:31.630
I plan to get close to him from now on.

118
09:32.050 --> 09:33.500
So, tell me.

119
09:38.570 --> 09:39.970
What's he been busy with?

120
09:40.110 --> 09:41.330
Right now.

121
09:45.940 --> 09:48.540
Who'd borrow money from you looking like this?

122
09:51.920 --> 09:55.380
Tell Kim Jitae I've returned the suit and the motorcycle keys.

123
09:55.710 --> 09:58.420
Since I got him Lee Hyunjae's phone, we're even.

124
10:02.180 --> 10:03.530
Looks like we have a guest.

125
10:03.530 --> 10:04.960
I said we're even.

126
10:05.600 --> 10:08.260
Jitae didn't mention anything about that to me.

127
10:26.120 --> 10:27.540
It's true.

128
10:28.100 --> 10:29.700
You really are here.

129
10:31.820 --> 10:32.940
Leave.

130
10:34.360 --> 10:36.420
What if I say I'm here to borrow money?

131
10:36.520 --> 10:38.070
Are you free?

132
10:39.470 --> 10:41.070
Let's go in together.

133
10:41.340 --> 10:42.540
I'm here to borrow money.

134
10:42.540 --> 10:45.520
What kind of place do you think this is to borrow money from?

135
10:45.520 --> 10:48.050
How could I not know what kind of place this is?

136
10:48.320 --> 10:49.950
It's where you work.

137
10:51.290 --> 10:52.260
Hey,

138
10:52.420 --> 10:54.020
is he here for drugs or a loan?

139
10:54.540 --> 10:56.020
Let him in now.

140
11:06.190 --> 11:07.350
Take this.

141
11:08.190 --> 11:10.380
You'll do anything for money, right?

142
11:11.870 --> 11:14.890
Be my vending machine instead.

143
11:17.170 --> 11:18.390
What?

144
11:20.660 --> 11:22.330
This watch is expensive.

145
11:22.500 --> 11:24.490
It's worth a lot. Go sell it.

146
11:25.480 --> 11:27.790
Until this money runs out,

147
11:28.580 --> 11:31.020
don't do this kind of dirty work.

148
11:38.100 --> 11:39.340
Hey.

149
11:42.480 --> 11:45.340
I'm not taking what's yours, you freaking bastard.

150
11:58.280 --> 11:59.860
Damn it.

151
12:01.270 --> 12:03.530
What do you want me to do?

152
12:16.710 --> 12:17.870
Mr. Jang!

153
12:18.390 --> 12:20.300
Skipping cleaning means a demerit, right?

154
12:20.300 --> 12:22.100
Hyunjae left without cleaning.

155
12:25.300 --> 12:27.100
I'll go find him. Keep cleaning.

156
12:27.120 --> 12:28.070
Okay.

157
12:39.940 --> 12:41.050
I did it...

158
12:43.100 --> 12:45.910
because I like you.

159
12:52.890 --> 12:54.000
Lee Hyunjae!

160
13:04.340 --> 13:08.440
The counselor, Ms. Lee Ga-eun, said she's doing the counseling.

161
13:08.890 --> 13:12.160
No, I told Hyunjae the counseling is off.

162
13:13.750 --> 13:15.530
Have you decided to listen to me

163
13:15.710 --> 13:17.460
about leaving Hyunjae alone?

164
13:19.210 --> 13:21.190
No matter how uncomfortable it gets,

165
13:21.190 --> 13:23.120
it's better to keep your position.

166
13:23.430 --> 13:25.470
Be low-key, meek,

167
13:25.800 --> 13:27.240
and play dumb.

168
13:27.540 --> 13:29.700
Aren't you good at that?

169
13:48.080 --> 13:50.450
Why haven't you been picking up?

170
13:51.520 --> 13:54.410
-Mom. -Your mom came to my office.

171
13:54.790 --> 13:56.050
And she's drunk.

172
13:56.580 --> 13:58.960
I already called him. He'll be here soon.

173
14:03.110 --> 14:04.970
Let's talk after I get off work, Mom.

174
14:04.970 --> 14:08.710
Gosh, you two don't even care that my heart is breaking, huh?

175
14:13.280 --> 14:14.190
Get up.

176
14:14.320 --> 14:15.630
Let go of me!

177
14:15.780 --> 14:18.710
I'm not leaving until you promise to patch things up.

178
14:18.960 --> 14:20.300
I told you to get up.

179
14:20.430 --> 14:21.480
What the hell?

180
14:22.640 --> 14:23.710
Mom.

181
14:23.890 --> 14:25.760
I said I'm not leaving!

182
14:30.210 --> 14:32.440
Let's talk at home. Don't make a scene here.

183
14:32.440 --> 14:35.350
Don't even try to persuade me.

184
14:35.470 --> 14:37.570
I won't listen.

185
14:41.100 --> 14:42.370
Go in.

186
14:42.560 --> 14:44.620
I'll call the police and settle this.

187
14:44.750 --> 14:45.580
The police?

188
14:45.720 --> 14:47.380
Hey, hey! Why call the police?

189
14:47.420 --> 14:49.790
Why call the police? It's so embarrassing!

190
14:49.790 --> 14:51.230
And what you're doing isn't embarrassing?

191
14:51.230 --> 14:52.170
Stop. Don't do it.

192
14:52.170 --> 14:53.610
Why call the police?

193
14:53.840 --> 14:54.540
Don't.

194
14:54.700 --> 14:56.370
Why call the police?

195
14:56.480 --> 14:58.710
Then what do you want me to do?

196
15:09.350 --> 15:11.470
Mom, you're drunk.

197
15:11.950 --> 15:13.010
Let's talk at home.

198
15:13.110 --> 15:15.590
I can't even face Jiyoung right now.

199
15:21.470 --> 15:23.250
Please.

200
15:31.870 --> 15:33.980
No, just...

201
15:34.190 --> 15:37.260
pretend to like each other and live together.

202
15:38.610 --> 15:40.910
You always do this every now and then,

203
15:41.150 --> 15:43.570
only to end up listening to me anyway.

204
16:02.630 --> 16:04.600
Why didn't you just avoid it?

205
16:09.070 --> 16:12.070
Avoid it like you've always done.

206
16:13.440 --> 16:16.690
You already knew our situation. You knew, but...

207
16:17.880 --> 16:20.480
You just want me to be flawless in other people's eyes,

208
16:20.480 --> 16:22.360
so you kept playing dumb.

209
16:24.450 --> 16:27.890
If I kept avoiding it, would you two

210
16:28.060 --> 16:30.280
have gone back to living like before?

211
16:30.980 --> 16:32.250
Like before?

212
16:32.470 --> 16:33.850
You mean like what you want?

213
16:33.850 --> 16:37.330
Yeah, like what I want! What's wrong with that?

214
16:43.080 --> 16:44.610
You

215
16:44.870 --> 16:47.200
can't be like me.

216
16:47.990 --> 16:52.830
I can't stand you being seen as someone flawed.

217
16:53.100 --> 16:55.150
There's no such thing as a flawless person.

218
16:55.150 --> 16:55.820
There is.

219
16:55.960 --> 16:57.020
You!

220
16:57.150 --> 16:59.070
That's how I raised you!

221
17:00.090 --> 17:01.920
Then you failed.

222
17:05.000 --> 17:07.170
Afraid of people finding my faults, I keep quiet.

223
17:07.170 --> 17:09.700
No matter what happened, I keep my mouth shut.

224
17:11.349 --> 17:14.140
I grew up to be dull and cowardly.

225
17:15.260 --> 17:18.079
I knew you were an alcoholic, but even at my age,

226
17:18.089 --> 17:21.069
I never dared to tell you to get treatment!

227
17:21.359 --> 17:22.970
Keep your voice down.

228
17:25.000 --> 17:26.730
You know what?

229
17:29.920 --> 17:32.380
You hate flaws the most,

230
17:33.860 --> 17:36.250
and the biggest flaw in my life...

231
17:39.240 --> 17:41.060
is you.

232
17:51.960 --> 17:54.260
I'll pay the bill. Find your own way back.

233
17:54.860 --> 17:56.050
You...

234
17:57.350 --> 17:58.910
You've changed.

235
17:59.830 --> 18:01.940
You weren't like this before.

236
18:03.340 --> 18:05.100
I've always been like this.

237
18:06.340 --> 18:08.530
You just didn't know.

238
18:09.550 --> 18:10.920
Son.

239
18:25.000 --> 18:26.560
For the first time...

240
18:29.470 --> 18:32.790
I admitted that I have flaws.

241
18:45.750 --> 18:47.050
And...

242
18:49.740 --> 18:53.340
it reminded me of how I deliberately created flaws my whole life.

243
19:15.350 --> 19:16.880
What are you looking for?

244
19:20.620 --> 19:22.140
Do you need money?

245
19:22.530 --> 19:23.110
Yes.

246
19:23.260 --> 19:24.350
How much?

247
19:24.970 --> 19:26.400
Twenty million.

248
19:29.750 --> 19:31.840
I'll handle it. Come out.

249
19:31.940 --> 19:33.390
If you're going to tell my father,

250
19:33.390 --> 19:34.560
I might as well just sell this—

251
19:34.560 --> 19:36.550
I won't tell him.

252
19:37.970 --> 19:39.600
Come out first.

253
19:50.450 --> 19:52.230
Handle it for me now.

254
19:53.830 --> 19:55.210
Right now.

255
19:58.090 --> 20:00.000
[Daily installment loan consulting]

256
20:06.430 --> 20:08.960
I'm almost done with my cigarette, Hyunjong.

257
20:09.030 --> 20:10.920
It isn't a tough request.

258
20:11.970 --> 20:13.770
Just stick out your tongue.

259
20:14.050 --> 20:15.470
I'm sorry.

260
20:15.970 --> 20:18.450
Seriously, I'll pay you back tomorrow.

261
20:18.520 --> 20:20.600
Just... give me one more day.

262
20:21.300 --> 20:23.630
I have nowhere to put out my cigarette.

263
20:24.990 --> 20:27.090
Let me have a go too.

264
20:28.060 --> 20:29.340
Boss.

265
20:30.260 --> 20:31.190
I'm busy.

266
20:31.350 --> 20:33.610
I know, but 20 million came in.

267
20:33.890 --> 20:35.280
Lee Hyunjae sent it.

268
20:38.880 --> 20:40.170
[Yes Bank: 20,000,000 won from Dongjin]

269
20:46.840 --> 20:48.850
I'm in a good mood, so I'll let you off this once.

270
20:48.850 --> 20:50.780
Pay it back by tomorrow, Hyunjong.

271
20:55.520 --> 20:56.780
I'm going out for a bit.

272
20:56.780 --> 20:58.030
Where are you going?

273
21:00.490 --> 21:02.410
To deliver the phone.

274
21:02.930 --> 21:06.860
[Kiwoo-hyung, can we meet now? I have something to give you.]

275
21:07.210 --> 21:10.140
Reply. Reply. Reply. What's taking so long? Damn it.

276
21:12.230 --> 21:14.160
Want to come over?

277
21:14.400 --> 21:15.440
Okay.

278
21:29.070 --> 21:30.870
Your eyes are glassy.

279
21:33.070 --> 21:35.770
How did you know I'm into glassy eyes?

280
21:36.440 --> 21:37.960
One beer, please!

281
21:43.500 --> 21:46.180
My job only deals with glassy-eyed people.

282
21:49.280 --> 21:51.120
Is there such a job?

283
22:01.130 --> 22:02.720
Today, you really look

284
22:03.510 --> 22:05.340
like you need someone. Anyone.

285
22:05.480 --> 22:07.200
Good timing, right?

286
22:09.610 --> 22:11.100
Sort of.

287
22:13.160 --> 22:15.970
I thought of someone...

288
22:17.760 --> 22:20.370
but I couldn't call him.

289
22:23.340 --> 22:25.280
In case I give myself away.

290
22:30.080 --> 22:31.740
You're wavering, aren't you?

291
22:36.130 --> 22:37.660
I don't know.

292
22:39.190 --> 22:41.800
Poor Hyunjae.

293
22:42.100 --> 22:45.520
He's going to get hurt if he finds out

294
22:46.330 --> 22:48.950
that your heart is wavering for someone else.

295
22:58.180 --> 23:00.040
Please return his phone to him.

296
23:03.880 --> 23:06.290
I wanted to play with you a little longer,

297
23:07.170 --> 23:08.970
but since I've gotten the money,

298
23:09.010 --> 23:10.860
I can't play anymore.

299
23:13.070 --> 23:14.850
That person, "Full Moon,"

300
23:16.970 --> 23:19.500
you've been chatting with isn't me.

301
23:24.030 --> 23:25.550
Who is it then?

302
23:26.880 --> 23:28.210
Lee Hyunjae.

303
23:29.140 --> 23:31.100
The Lee Hyunjae

304
23:31.500 --> 23:32.960
from your school.

305
23:36.760 --> 23:38.230
Interesting, isn't it?

306
23:51.200 --> 23:52.410
Cheers.

307
24:02.490 --> 24:04.960
He always had a dark side.

308
24:12.150 --> 24:14.680
Maybe because he grew up being abused at home.

309
24:14.760 --> 24:16.160
Is it handled?

310
24:19.450 --> 24:20.810
Is it done?

311
24:24.850 --> 24:26.980
He probably approached you on purpose

312
24:27.070 --> 24:28.280
from the beginning.

313
24:32.940 --> 24:35.810
Yes, the money has been transferred.

314
24:39.360 --> 24:42.980
He said to go to Jang Kiwoo to get your phone.

315
24:48.330 --> 24:50.190
He might go looking for you today.

316
24:55.350 --> 24:56.780
Are you not home?

317
25:01.860 --> 25:03.250
Mr. Jang.

318
25:08.070 --> 25:09.270
Mr. Jang.

319
25:16.740 --> 25:18.220
Mr. Jang.

320
25:25.140 --> 25:27.190
Mr. Jang, did you drink?

321
25:57.770 --> 26:03.190
[Boy, with Caution]

322
26:03.250 --> 26:05.890
Do you find it fun messing with people

323
26:06.020 --> 26:07.470
who have dull lives?

324
26:07.520 --> 26:08.850
So, did your heart waver?

325
26:08.850 --> 26:10.250
Don't flatter yourself.

326
26:10.450 --> 26:12.560
Have you seen this on Instagram?

327
26:12.600 --> 26:14.300
Is Jang Kiwoo a serial creep?

328
26:14.970 --> 26:17.460
That's why I told you not to show him too much care.

329
26:17.460 --> 26:18.480
Say it yourself.

330
26:18.660 --> 26:19.870
Or should I say it first?

331
26:19.870 --> 26:22.200
I can't go back to how things were with you.

332
26:23.130 --> 26:24.260
Who is Lee Hyunjae?

333
26:24.380 --> 26:26.410
I heard he is the chairman's son.

334
26:26.410 --> 26:27.740
How can I believe it?

335
26:28.710 --> 26:30.090
Have a proper look.

336
26:31.220 --> 26:33.970
Do you finally see how

337
26:35.010 --> 26:36.720
affection can go wrong?
